# Docs

- One concern per file. Update the existing file; do not append unrelated sections.
- `CONTEXT.md`: terms, aliases, flagged ambiguities. No implementation.
- `docs/modules/<name>.md`: one file per code module.
- `docs/adr/NNNN-title.md`: only for costly, considered decisions.
- Keep `docs/README.md` index links accurate when adding a file.
- Do not duplicate `no-push/` extracts into `docs/`.
